A put becomes more valuable when share prices drop;
These short-dated, out-of-the-money puts needed a plunge—and fast—to come out on top.
On May 22, China announced a cross-border trading crackdown;
The brokerage shares tumbled, and the put buyers’ gains reached $71.4 million.

